# API communication

- One Tanstack Query client per API under `services/[api-name]/client/`
- Interceptors for auth and error normalization
- Zod schemas in `services/[api-name]/schemas/`
- Export types via `z.infer<typeof Schema>`
- Never trust raw response shapes in UI code

```ts
const UserSchema = z.object({ id: z.string(), name: z.string() });
export type User = z.infer<typeof UserSchema>;
```

Details: `docs/frontend/tools/API_COMMUNICATION.md`
